OL,3,GNEWSAI wish we'd pushed sooner, says
OL,4,Awife of cancer patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Craig Sullivan started getting
OL,7,Fstomach pain, he put it down to a
OL,8,Fstressful house move and having a lot
OL,9,Fon at work.
OL,11,FAt 44, Craig's stomach issues were
OL,12,Finitially put down to irritable bowel
OL,13,Fsyndrome.
OL,15,FHowever, his condition worsened and,
OL,16,Fafter tests and scans, the father of
OL,17,Ftwo was diagnosed with stage four
OL,18,Fpancreatic cancer a year later.
OL,20,FHis wife Natalie, from Ruddington in
OL,21,FNottinghamshire, says: "I wish we'd
OL,22,Fpushed for more help sooner."
